</style><style>:root{padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)}</style></head><body><div class="gutter"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1120px]"><header class="border-b border-line"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-x-8 gap-y-3 py-5"><a href="index.html" class="font-mono text-sm text-muted no-underline hover:text-ink">andrewbeechey.me.uk</a><nav class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-1 font-mono text-sm" aria-label="Main"><a href="index.html" class="no-underline text-muted hover:text-ink" >home</a><a href="projects.html" class="no-underline text-muted hover:text-ink" >projects</a><a href="experience.html" class="no-underline text-amber" aria-current="page">experience</a><a href="skills.html" class="no-underline text-muted hover:text-ink" >skills</a><a href="education.html" class="no-underline text-muted hover:text-ink" >education</a><a href="contact.html" class="no-underline text-muted hover:text-ink" >contact</a></nav></div></header><main class="flex flex-col gap-14 py-12"><div><p class="font-mono text-sm text-amber mb-3">// experience</p><h1 class="display text-4xl sm:text-6xl leading-none">Experience</h1><p class="text-muted max-w-xl mt-3">Web development and IT support first, then earlier roles back to 2009.</p></div><div><article class="grid md:grid-cols-[14rem_1fr] gap-x-8 gap-y-3 py-8 border-t border-line"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-muted">Ongoing</p><div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="inline-block font-mono text-xs px-2.5 py-1 border border-line text-muted">Web</span></div></div><div class="min-w-0"><h2 class="display text-2xl !font-semibold leading-snug">Independent web developer</h2><p class="text-amber mb-4">Personal and gaming clan projects</p><ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 max-w-2xl text-soft"><li class="pl-5 relative before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.8em] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-amber">20 years of hands-on HTML, CSS and PHP, building personal sites and websites for gaming clans I have been part of.</li><li class="pl-5 relative before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.8em] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-amber">The last five years learning and building with Laravel and Tailwind CSS.</li><li class="pl-5 relative before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.8em] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-amber">Current projects in development: LaraCMS, LumenGallery and a profile site under my gaming handle, Vilkrin.</li></ul></div></article><article class="grid md:grid-cols-[14rem_1fr] gap-x-8 gap-y-3 py-8 border-t border-line"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-muted">May – Jun 2024</p><div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="inline-block font-mono text-xs px-2.5 py-1 border border-line text-muted">IT</span></div></div><div class="min-w-0"><h2 class="display text-2xl !font-semibold leading-snug">Junior System Support Technician</h2><p class="text-amber mb-4">Waltham Forest Adult Learning Service</p><ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 max-w-2xl text-soft"><li class="pl-5 relative before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.8em] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-amber">Set up four IT suites and replaced old hardware: two suites with iMacs and two with Windows PCs.</li><li class="pl-5 relative before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.8em] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-amber">Configured two Proxmox servers from scratch, each running Windows Server as a guest, and promoted them to domain controllers with Active Directory, users, group policies and permissions.</li><li class="pl-5 relative before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.8em] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-amber">Deployed shared resources including shared drives and multiple printers.</li><li class="pl-5 relative before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.8em] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-amber">Configured DHCP and DNS on the Windows server to take over from the ISP router.</li></ul></div></article><article class="grid md:grid-cols-[14rem_1fr] gap-x-8 gap-y-3 py-8 border-t border-line"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-muted">10 Jun 2015 – Sep 2016</p><div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="inline-block font-mono text-xs px-2.5 py-1 border border-line text-muted">E-commerce</span><span class="inline-block font-mono text-xs px-2.5 py-1 border border-line text-muted">Web</span></div></div><div class="min-w-0"><h2 class="display text-2xl !font-semibold leading-snug">Founder & Managing Director</h2><p class="text-amber mb-4">Waltham Games Ltd, London</p><ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 max-w-2xl text-soft"><li class="pl-5 relative before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.8em] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-amber">Set up the Magento e-commerce store for live trading, and kept it running.</li><li class="pl-5 relative before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.8em] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-amber">Listed stock on the company website, eBay and Amazon, then picked, packed and posted orders.</li><li class="pl-5 relative before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.8em] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-amber">Ran payroll and accounts in Sage One, ordered stock and supplies, and set up supply chains to keep margins steady.</li><li class="pl-5 relative before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.8em] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-amber">Set growth strategy and budgets for marketing, operations and technology.</li></ul></div></article><article class="grid md:grid-cols-[14rem_1fr] gap-x-8 gap-y-3 py-8 border-t border-line"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-muted">Sep 2014 – Sep 2015 · Mar 2017 – Mar 2020</p><div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="inline-block font-mono text-xs px-2.5 py-1 border border-line text-muted">Retail</span></div></div><div class="min-w-0"><h2 class="display text-2xl !font-semibold leading-snug">Sales Assistant / Cashier (Volunteer)</h2><p class="text-amber mb-4">Crest Charity Shop, Walthamstow</p><ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 max-w-2xl text-soft"><li class="pl-5 relative before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.8em] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-amber">Sorted donations, put new stock out on the shop floor and kept the shop tidy and presentable.</li><li class="pl-5 relative before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.8em] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-amber">Took cash payments, issued receipts, refunds and change, and counted the till at the start of each shift.</li><li class="pl-5 relative before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.8em] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-amber">Greeted customers, checked prices, and opened and closed the shop.</li></ul></div></article><article class="grid md:grid-cols-[14rem_1fr] gap-x-8 gap-y-3 py-8 border-t border-line"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-muted">Nov – Dec 2016</p><div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="inline-block font-mono text-xs px-2.5 py-1 border border-line text-muted">Warehouse</span></div></div><div class="min-w-0"><h2 class="display text-2xl !font-semibold leading-snug">Warehouse Operative (temporary roles)</h2><p class="text-amber mb-4">APG Recruitment Ltd</p><ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 max-w-2xl text-soft"><li class="pl-5 relative before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.8em] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-amber">Picked and packed orders, unloaded containers onto pallets, and loaded vans for delivery.</li></ul></div></article><article class="grid md:grid-cols-[14rem_1fr] gap-x-8 gap-y-3 py-8 border-t border-line"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-muted">Sep – Oct 2016</p><div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="inline-block font-mono text-xs px-2.5 py-1 border border-line text-muted">Warehouse</span></div></div><div class="min-w-0"><h2 class="display text-2xl !font-semibold leading-snug">Warehouse Operative</h2><p class="text-amber mb-4">Sainsbury's, Waltham Abbey</p><ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 max-w-2xl text-soft"><li class="pl-5 relative before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.8em] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-amber">Packed goods onto roll cages from the conveyor and closed them ready for loading onto lorries.</li></ul></div></article><article class="grid md:grid-cols-[14rem_1fr] gap-x-8 gap-y-3 py-8 border-t border-line"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-muted">Mar 2010 – May 2011</p><div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="inline-block font-mono text-xs px-2.5 py-1 border border-line text-muted">Support</span></div></div><div class="min-w-0"><h2 class="display text-2xl !font-semibold leading-snug">Operations Support Executive</h2><p class="text-amber mb-4">TalkTalk, North Acton, London</p><ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 max-w-2xl text-soft"><li class="pl-5 relative before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.8em] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-amber">Handled high-level escalations from first-line contact centre advisors, working with Opal (SMC) and BT.</li><li class="pl-5 relative before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.8em] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-amber">Recommended ways to improve efficiency and planned processes around technical problems.</li><li class="pl-5 relative before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.8em] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-amber">Worked with senior managers and advisors from non-technical backgrounds, raising and updating tickets in Remedy.</li></ul></div></article><article class="grid md:grid-cols-[14rem_1fr] gap-x-8 gap-y-3 py-8 border-t border-line"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-muted">Nov 2009 – Jan 2010</p><div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="inline-block font-mono text-xs px-2.5 py-1 border border-line text-muted">Support</span></div></div><div class="min-w-0"><h2 class="display text-2xl !font-semibold leading-snug">Customer Service Agent</h2><p class="text-amber mb-4">Lebara, Tower Hill, London</p><ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 max-w-2xl text-soft"><li class="pl-5 relative before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.8em] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-amber">Entered customer registrations and answered inbound calls and emails with accurate product and service information.</li><li class="pl-5 relative before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.8em] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-amber">Made outbound after-sales calls, investigated customer problems and gave fast resolutions.</li><li class="pl-5 relative before:absolute before:left-0 before:top-[0.8em] before:w-2.5 before:h-px before:bg-amber">Raised tickets to track customer issues and resolved them over the phone.</li></ul></div></article></div></main><footer class="border-t border-line mt-4"><div class="py-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 font-mono text-sm text-muted"><span>© Andrew Beechey · London, UK</span><span class="flex gap-6"><a class="text-amber no-underline hover:text-ink" href="https://github.com/Vilkrin">github</a><a class="text-amber no-underline hover:text-ink" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/in/abeechey">linkedin</a></span></div></footer></div></div><script>document.querySelectorAll('[data-copy]').forEach(function(b){var l=b.textContent;b.addEventListener('click',function(){var t=b.getAttribute('data-copy');function ok(){b.textContent='Copied \u2713';b.classList.add('done');setTimeout(function(){b.textContent=l;b.classList.remove('done')},2000)}function fb(){try{var a=document.createElement('textarea');a.value=t;a.setAttribute('readonly','');a.style.position='fixed';a.style.opacity='0';document.body.appendChild(a);a.select();var r=document.execCommand('copy');document.body.removeChild(a);if(r)ok()}catch(e){}}try{navigator.clipboard.writeText(t).then(ok,fb)}catch(e){fb()}})});</script></body></html>